{"product_id":"the-richard-laymon-collection-beware-and-dark-mountain-v-4","title":"The Richard Laymon Collection: \"Beware\" AND \"Dark Mountain\" v. 4","description":"\u003cp\u003eBEWARE! Elsie doesn't normally shut shop early, but neither is it normal for meat cleavers to fly through the air by themselves, or for Elsie to wind up on the meat counter neatly wrapped and jointed. Something very strange is happening in the small town of Oasis and everyone had better... BEWARE! DARK MOUNTAIN It was supposed to be a peaceful escape for the two families camping high in the California mountains. But they made the mistake of camping at Mesquite lake, home to two of the wilderness's most terrifying inhabitants: an aged hag with gruesome powers and her depraved son whose unnatural lusts even she cannot control...\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Richard Laymon\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780755331710\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 416\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 197\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594338078873,"sku":"9RE9780755331710","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-richard-laymon-collection-beware-and-dark-mountain-v-4-531927.jpg?v=1694792473","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-richard-laymon-collection-beware-and-dark-mountain-v-4","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}